WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:18.537
Kip was sad.

2
00:00:18.538 --> 00:00:28.307
He wanted to have a great birthday party.

3
00:00:28.308 --> 00:00:33.236
But he didn't have cupcakes.

4
00:00:33.237 --> 00:00:43.234
He didn't have party games.

5
00:00:43.235 --> 00:00:49.588
He didn't have decorations.

6
00:00:49.589 --> 00:00:53.134
And he forgot to invite everyone.

7
00:00:53.135 --> 00:00:59.079
"This is terrible," said Kip.

8
00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:03.594
"I think I'll just go home."

9
00:01:03.595 --> 00:01:06.887
Kip started to walk home when suddenly . . .

10
00:01:06.888 --> 00:01:10.920
All of Kip's friends jumped out!

11
00:01:10.921 --> 00:01:14.816
"Surprise!" they all yelled.

12
00:01:14.817 --> 00:01:17.806
"Happy Birthday, Kip!" said Bird.

13
00:01:17.807 --> 00:01:20.421
"We're here for your party!"

14
00:01:20.422 --> 00:01:24.276
"There is no party," said Kip.

15
00:01:24.277 --> 00:01:27.391
"I messed up everything."

16
00:01:27.392 --> 00:01:41.727
"No problem," said Bird.

17
00:01:41.728 --> 00:01:46.459
"We brought cupcakes, games, and decorations!"

18
00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.880
"You brought a whole party!" said Kip.

19
00:01:49.881 --> 00:01:58.157
Everyone played party games.

20
00:01:58.158 --> 00:02:03.898
Then they sang "Happy Birthday" to Kip.

21
00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:08.315
Kip blew out the candles.

22
00:02:08.316 --> 00:02:12.143
"What did you wish for?" asked Bird.

23
00:02:12.144 --> 00:02:16.017
"Nothing," said Kip.

24
00:02:16.018 --> 00:02:23.537
"I already have everything I need right here!"
